81009157896.013, pp. 1513-1766, Table 11.5 (Africa, heavy precipitation), p. 1620, row Sahara (SAH). Final chapter PDF: https://www.ipcc.ch/report/ar6/wg1/downloads/report/IPCC_AR6_WGI_ch11.pdf","confidence":"Low confidence; insufficient data to assess trends","confidence_es":"Confianza baja; datos insuficientes para evaluar tendencias","direction":null,"agreement":null,"ar6_region":"SAH","scope":"extremes","partial":false}],"verdict":{"label":"cant_tell","certainty":"cant_tell","answer":{"simple":"We can't answer this for Sahara near Tamanrasset, Algeria yet.","scientific":"Bias-corrected precipitation (NASA POWER, MERRA-2-based), Sahara near Tamanrasset, Algeria (point 22.79, 5.52): not assessable.","simple_es":"Aún no podemos responder esto para Sahara cerca de Tamanrasset, Argelia.","scientific_es":"Precipitación con corrección de sesgo (NASA POWER, basada en MERRA-2), Sahara cerca de Tamanrasset, Argelia (punto 22,79; 5,52): no evaluable."},"how_much":{"simple":"It hardly ever rains here, so monthly numbers can't show a trend.","scientific":"36.9% of months in the window are at or below 0 (maximum 30%; ties make Mann–Kendall and Sen's slope degenerate).","simple_es":"Aquí casi nunca llueve. Los números mensuales no pueden mostrar un cambio.","scientific_es":"36.9% de los meses de la ventana están en o por debajo de 0 (máximo 30%; los empates vuelven degeneradas la prueba de Mann–Kendall y la pendiente de Sen)."},"headline":{"simple":"We can't tell here","scientific":"Not assessable","simple_es":"No podemos saberlo aquí","scientific_es":"No evaluable"},"sentence":{"simple":"It hardly ever rains here, so monthly numbers can't show a trend.","scientific":"Failed gates. 36.9% of months in the window are at or below 0 (maximum 30%; ties make Mann–Kendall and Sen's slope degenerate).","simple_es":"Aquí casi nunca llueve. Los números mensuales no pueden mostrar un cambio.","scientific_es":"Comprobaciones no superadas. 36.9% de los meses de la ventana están en o por de